        "rationale": "Passage F013 establishes that de minimis releases are 'not subject to this prohibition', which solely targets the venting prohibition under paragraph (a)(1) (C0000). The text does not make de minimis releases an exemption to the separate violation rule for knowing release after recovery in paragraph (a)(3) (C0003), nor does it exempt parties from the affirmative practice and equipment requirements of paragraph (b) (C0004). In fact, observing those practices and using certified equipment is an express prerequisite under paragraph (a)(2)(i) for a release to qualify as de minimis. Qualifying C0003 and C0004 is therefore unsupported.",
